<title>SWITZERLAND: PRESS DIGEST - Switzerland - July 7.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Switzerland - July 7.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here are the highlights from Swiss newspapers on Monday:</p>
<p>NEUE ZUERCHER ZEITUNG</p>
<p>- Iran protested to the Federal Department of Foreign Affairs against recent accusations of espionage in the Swiss media.</p>
<p>TAGES ANZEIGER</p>
<p>- Debrunner Koenig Holding (DKH) acquired Davum Stahl AG.</p>
<p>- Migros wants to invest 100 million Swiss Francs to restructure the Globus subsidiary ABM.</p>
<p>JOURNAL DE GENEVE</p>
<p>- Alusuisse Lonza Group plans to double its business to more than 15 billion Swiss francs before the year 2002.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
